    <div class="modal-backdrop stocktake-subdialog" data-modal="stocktake-create"><section class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="stocktake-create-title"><div class="modal-header"><div><h2 id="stocktake-create-title">新建盘点任务</h2><p>创建时固定本批次的账面数量快照</p></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-stocktake-subdialog title="关闭"><X size={18} /></button></div><div class="modal-body"><form data-stocktake-create-form><div class="form-grid"><div class="field full"><label for="stocktake-create-name">盘点批次名称</label><input id="stocktake-create-name" maxlength="80" autocomplete="off" required /></div><div class="field full"><label>盘点范围</label><div class="segmented stocktake-create-scope-mode" role="group" aria-label="盘点范围"><button class="segment active" type="button" data-stocktake-scope-mode="all" aria-pressed="true">全部耗材</button><button class="segment" type="button" data-stocktake-scope-mode="category" aria-pressed="false">按分类</button><button class="segment" type="button" data-stocktake-scope-mode="material" aria-pressed="false">单项耗材</button></div><span class="field-hint">大批盘点可选全部或分类；临时抽盘和差异复核可搜索单项耗材。</span></div><div class="field full stocktake-create-scope-field" data-stocktake-category-field hidden><label for="stocktake-create-category">耗材分类</label><select id="stocktake-create-category" data-stocktake-create-category disabled><option value="">请选择分类</option></select></div><div class="field full stocktake-create-scope-field" data-stocktake-material-field hidden><label for="stocktake-create-material">单项耗材</label><input id="stocktake-create-material" list="stocktake-create-material-options" placeholder="搜索名称、分类或规格" autocomplete="off" disabled /><datalist id="stocktake-create-material-options" data-stocktake-create-material-options></datalist><span class="field-hint">选择一种耗材；探针等追踪耗材会包含该耗材下的全部在用盒子。</span></div></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="button" type="button" data-close-stocktake-subdialog>取消</button><button class="button primary" type="submit"><Plus size={16} />创建任务</button></div></form></div></section></div>

    <div class="modal-backdrop stocktake-subdialog" data-modal="stocktake-count"><section class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="stocktake-count-title"><div class="modal-header"><div><h2 id="stocktake-count-title" data-stocktake-count-title>登记实盘数量</h2><p data-stocktake-count-subtitle>填写现场清点结果</p></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-stocktake-subdialog title="关闭"><X size={18} /></button></div><div class="modal-body"><div class="stocktake-count-summary"><div><span>账面快照</span><strong data-stocktake-count-expected>-</strong></div><div><span>当前系统</span><strong data-stocktake-count-current>-</strong></div><div><span>盘点对象</span><strong data-stocktake-count-scope>-</strong></div></div><form data-stocktake-count-form><div class="form-grid"><div class="field full"><label for="stocktake-counted-quantity">实盘数量</label><input id="stocktake-counted-quantity" type="number" min="0" step="any" inputmode="decimal" required /></div><div class="field full" data-stocktake-reason-field hidden><label for="stocktake-difference-reason">差异原因</label><textarea id="stocktake-difference-reason" maxlength="300" placeholder="例如：领用漏登、破损未登记或上次盘点误差"></textarea></div><div class="field full"><label for="stocktake-resolution-note" data-stocktake-resolution-label>处理说明（选填）</label><textarea id="stocktake-resolution-note" maxlength="500" placeholder="记录已经采取或计划采取的处理"></textarea></div></div><div class="stocktake-readiness warning" data-stocktake-tracked-guidance hidden><AlertTriangle size={17} /><span>按盒追踪耗材不会自动增减数量。发现差异后，请先打开该盒库存明细，逐根修正状态或位置，再完成盘点。</span></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="button tonal" type="button" data-stocktake-open-inventory-detail hidden><ClipboardList size={16} />打开库存明细</button><button class="button" type="button" data-close-stocktake-subdialog>取消</button><button class="button primary" type="submit"><Check size={16} />保存实盘</button></div></form></div></section></div>

