    <div class="modal-backdrop" data-modal="member"><section class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="member-title"><div class="modal-header"><div><h2 id="member-title">添加组内成员</h2><p>创建一个不需要邮箱的登录账号</p></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-modal title="关闭"><X size={18} /></button></div><div class="modal-body"><form data-member-form><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="member-name">姓名</label><input id="member-name" required /></div><div class="field"><label for="member-username">登录账号</label><input id="member-username" autocomplete="off" required /></div><div class="field"><label for="member-password">初始密码</label><input id="member-password" type="password" minlength="8" autocomplete="new-password" required /></div><div class="field"><label for="member-role">身份</label><select id="member-role"><option value="member">普通成员</option><option value="inventory">库存管理员</option><option value="admin">系统管理员</option></select></div><div class="field full"><label for="member-group">所属组织分组</label><select id="member-group" data-group-select required></select><span class="field-hint">每位成员只属于一个组织分组，出库消耗按发生时分组统计。</span></div><div class="field full"><label>成员标签（可多选）</label><div class="tag-picker" data-tag-picker="member"></div><span class="field-hint">标签用于职责说明和检索，不作为消耗核算维度。</span></div><div class="field full"><label for="member-note">成员备注（选填）</label><textarea id="member-note" maxlength="300" placeholder="例如：负责光刻耗材；联系方式或值班安排"></textarea><span class="field-hint">启用账号的成员都能在成员目录看到这段内容。</span></div></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="button" type="button" data-close-modal>取消</button><button class="button primary" type="submit"><Check size={15} />创建账号</button></div></form></div></section></div>

    <div class="modal-backdrop" data-modal="member-action"><section class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="member-action-title"><div class="modal-header"><div><h2 id="member-action-title">管理成员</h2><p>成员信息、账号安全与登录状态</p></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-modal title="关闭"><X size={18} /></button></div><div class="modal-body"><div class="member-action-summary"><span class="avatar" data-member-action-avatar>员</span><span><strong data-member-action-name>成员</strong><small data-member-action-username>登录账号</small></span></div><div class="member-action-list"><section class="member-action-section"><h3>成员信息</h3><p>登录账号可修改，系统内部 ID 与历史流水保持不变。</p><form id="member-info-form" data-member-info-form><div class="member-info-grid"><div class="field"><label for="member-action-name">姓名</label><input id="member-action-name" maxlength="40" required /></div><div class="field"><label for="member-action-login">登录账号</label><input id="member-action-login" minlength="3" maxlength="32" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9._-]+" autocomplete="off" required /><span class="field-hint">3-32 位字母、数字、点、下划线或短横线</span></div><div class="field"><label for="member-action-role">身份</label><select id="member-action-role" required><option value="member">普通成员</option><option value="inventory">库存管理员</option><option value="admin">系统管理员</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="member-action-group">所属组织分组</label><select id="member-action-group" data-group-select required></select></div><div class="field full"><label>成员标签（可多选）</label><div class="tag-picker" data-tag-picker="member-action"></div><span class="field-hint">可多选职责标签；消耗统计仍只使用唯一组织分组。</span></div><div class="field full"><label for="member-action-note">成员备注（选填）</label><textarea id="member-action-note" maxlength="300" placeholder="例如：负责光刻耗材；联系方式或值班安排"></textarea><span class="field-hint">成员目录会向启用中的成员显示。</span></div></div></form></section><section class="member-action-section"><h3>重置密码</h3><p>设置后，该成员已登录的会话将失效。</p><form data-reset-member-password><div class="field"><label for="member-reset-password">新密码</label><input id="member-reset-password" type="password" minlength="8" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="至少 8 位" required /></div><button class="button tonal" type="submit"><KeyRound size={16} />重置密码</button></form></section><section class="member-action-section"><h3>账号状态</h3><button class="button" type="button" data-toggle-member-status><span data-status-icon="disable"><UserX size={16} /></span><span class="is-hidden" data-status-icon="enable"><UserCheck size={16} /></span><span data-toggle-member-status-label>停用账号</span></button><button class="button danger" type="button" data-delete-member><Trash2 size={16} />删除账号</button></section><section class="member-action-section owner-transfer-section" data-owner-transfer-section hidden><h3>转移系统所有者</h3><p>转移后你将保留系统管理员身份，但只有新所有者能任命系统管理员或再次转移所有权。</p><form data-owner-transfer-form><div class="field"><label for="owner-transfer-password">你的当前密码</label><input id="owner-transfer-password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required /></div><button class="button danger" type="submit"><ShieldCheck size={16} />转移所有权</button></form></section></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="button" type="button" data-close-modal>取消</button><button class="button primary" type="submit" form="member-info-form" data-save-member-info><Check size={15} />保存成员信息</button></div></div></section></div>

    <div class="modal-backdrop" data-modal="material-action"><section class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="material-action-title"><div class="modal-header"><div><h2 id="material-action-title" data-material-action-title>管理耗材</h2><p data-material-action-subtitle>维护基础信息与安全库存线</p></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-modal title="关闭"><X size={18} /></button></div><div class="modal-body"><div class="current-stock-note"><span data-material-stock-label>当前库存只能通过出入库记录变更</span><strong data-edit-material-current-stock>0 件</strong></div><form data-material-action-form><div class="form-grid material-form-grid" data-material-fields><div class="field full"><label for="edit-material-name">耗材名称</label><input id="edit-material-name" maxlength="120" required /><span class="field-hint">不同规格需要分别管理库存时，请在名称中写明规格</span></div><div class="field"><label for="edit-material-category">分类</label><input id="edit-material-category" maxlength="80" required /></div><div class="field"><label for="edit-material-unit">单位</label><input id="edit-material-unit" list="material-unit-options" maxlength="20" required /><span class="field-hint">可自定义；有库存时不能直接更换单位，避免混淆历史流水</span></div><div class="field"><label for="edit-material-spec">规格、型号</label><input id="edit-material-spec" maxlength="120" /><span class="field-hint">用于区分容量、纯度、包装或型号，不参与库存计算</span></div><div class="field"><label for="edit-material-safety-stock">安全库存</label><input id="edit-material-safety-stock" type="number" min="0" step="1" required /><span class="field-hint">开放且可用数量小于或等于此数值时触发预警</span></div><div class="field full"><label for="edit-material-tracking-mode">库存管理方式</label><select id="edit-material-tracking-mode" required><option value="quantity">普通数量</option><option value="stateful">按状态统计</option><option value="tracked">按批次 / 单件管理</option></select><span class="field-hint">需要独立记录批次、盒号、序列号或位置时选择“按批次 / 单件管理”；有效期在新增批次时填写。</span></div><section class="tracking-mode-guidance" data-material-tracking-guidance-panel hidden><strong>启用后这样登记</strong><ol><li>先保存耗材档案。</li><li>进入“库存明细”，点击“新增批次 / 单件”。</li><li>选择批次、盒 / 容器或序列 / 单件，填写编号、数量和可选有效期。</li></ol><p>有效期是批次或库存单元的属性；没有填写有效期的库存不会产生提醒。</p><button class="button tonal" type="button" data-material-action-detail hidden><ClipboardList size={16} />打开库存明细</button></section><div class="field full" data-material-registration-guidance hidden><label for="edit-material-position-help">格位编号填写说明</label><textarea id="edit-material-position-help" maxlength="200" placeholder="例如：1-1 表示第一行第一个"></textarea><span class="field-hint">显示在格位编号输入框下方；短示例仍保留在输入框内。</span></div><div class="field full" data-material-registration-guidance hidden><label for="edit-material-usage-help">用途 / 实验项目填写说明</label><textarea id="edit-material-usage-help" maxlength="200" placeholder="例如：填写项目名称、实验批次或样品编号"></textarea><span class="field-hint">显示在使用登记中，不改变流水字段和导出结构。</span></div></div><section class="material-qr-action" data-material-action-qr-section hidden><div><h3>耗材二维码</h3><p>查看、下载或打印绑定当前耗材 UUID 的标签。</p></div><button class="button tonal" type="button" data-material-action-qr><QrCode size={16} />查看二维码标签</button></section><section class="material-lifecycle" data-material-lifecycle hidden><h3>耗材档案状态</h3><p data-material-lifecycle-hint>归档或永久删除不会改变已有出入库流水。</p><div class="material-lifecycle-actions"><button class="button tonal" type="button" data-toggle-material-status><Archive size={16} /><span data-toggle-material-status-label>归档耗材</span></button><button class="button" type="button" data-restore-material hidden><RotateCcw size={16} />恢复使用</button><button class="button danger" type="button" data-delete-material><Trash2 size={16} /><span data-delete-material-label>永久删除</span></button></div></section><div class="modal-footer"><button class="button" type="button" data-close-modal>取消</button><button class="button primary" type="submit" data-save-material><Check size={15} /><span data-material-submit-label>保存耗材信息</span></button></div></form></div></section></div>

    <div class="modal-backdrop" data-modal="material-info"><section class="modal material-info-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="material-info-title"><div class="modal-header"><div><h2 id="material-info-title" data-material-info-title>耗材详情</h2><p data-material-info-subtitle>查看完整信息与后续操作</p></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-modal title="关闭"><X size={18} /></button></div><div class="modal-body"><div class="material-info-actions"><button class="button tonal" type="button" data-material-info-detail hidden><ClipboardList size={16} />库存明细</button><button class="button tonal" type="button" data-material-info-qr><QrCode size={16} />二维码标签</button><button class="button" type="button" data-material-info-manage hidden><Settings size={16} />管理耗材</button></div><div class="material-info-list"><div class="material-info-item"><span>耗材名称</span><strong data-material-info-name>-</strong></div><div class="material-info-item"><span>分类</span><strong data-material-info-category>-</strong></div><div class="material-info-item"><span>规格 / 型号</span><strong data-material-info-spec>-</strong></div><div class="material-info-item"><span>当前库存</span><strong data-material-info-stock>-</strong></div><div class="material-info-item"><span>安全库存</span><strong data-material-info-safety>-</strong></div><div class="material-info-item"><span>管理方式</span><strong data-material-info-tracking>-</strong></div><div class="material-info-item"><span>档案状态</span><strong data-material-info-lifecycle>-</strong></div><div class="material-info-item"><span>最近更新</span><strong data-material-info-updated>-</strong></div></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="button primary" type="button" data-close-modal>关闭</button></div></div></section></div>


    <div class="modal-backdrop" data-modal="inventory-operation"><section class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="inventory-operation-title"><div class="modal-header"><div><h2 id="inventory-operation-title" data-inventory-operation-title>登记使用</h2><p data-inventory-operation-subtitle>记录使用，不改变当前库存数量</p></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-inventory-operation title="关闭"><X size={18} /></button></div><div class="modal-body"><div class="operation-source" data-operation-source><strong>库存明细</strong><span>请选择操作</span></div><form data-inventory-operation-form><div class="form-grid"><div class="field full" data-operation-type-field><label for="inventory-operation-type">维护操作</label><select id="inventory-operation-type" required><option value="state_change">变更状态</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="inventory-operation-quantity">数量</label><input id="inventory-operation-quantity" type="number" min="0.000001" step="any" value="1" required /></div><div class="field" data-operation-status-field><label for="inventory-operation-status">目标状态</label><select id="inventory-operation-status"></select></div><div class="field" data-operation-access-field><label for="inventory-operation-access">目标使用范围</label><select id="inventory-operation-access"><option value="shared">开放使用</option><option value="user">成员自用</option></select></div><div class="field" data-operation-owner-field hidden><label for="inventory-operation-owner">自用成员</label><select id="inventory-operation-owner"></select></div><div class="field" data-operation-position-field><label for="inventory-operation-position" data-operation-position-label>格位 / 单件编号</label><input id="inventory-operation-position" maxlength="40" placeholder="例如：2-3" /><span class="field-hint" data-operation-position-hint></span></div><div class="field" data-operation-context-field><label for="inventory-operation-counterparty" data-operation-counterparty-label>用途 / 实验项目</label><input id="inventory-operation-counterparty" maxlength="120" placeholder="例如：项目名称" /><span class="field-hint" data-operation-context-hint></span></div><div class="field"><label for="inventory-operation-date">发生时间</label><input id="inventory-operation-date" type="datetime-local" /></div><div class="field full"><label for="inventory-operation-note">备注</label><textarea id="inventory-operation-note" maxlength="500"></textarea></div></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="button" type="button" data-close-inventory-operation>取消</button><button class="button primary" type="submit"><Check size={15} /><span data-inventory-operation-submit-label>保存使用登记</span></button></div></form></div></section></div>

    <div class="modal-backdrop" data-modal="settings"><section class="modal settings-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="settings-title"><div class="modal-header"><div><h2 id="settings-title">系统设置</h2><p data-settings-subtitle>管理实验室、组织、标签与当前账号安全</p></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-modal title="关闭"><X size={18} /></button></div><div class="modal-body"><div class="segmented settings-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="设置分类"><button class="segment active" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-settings-tab="lab"><Building2 size={15} />实验室信息</button><button class="segment" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-settings-tab="groups"><Users size={15} />组织与标签</button><button class="segment" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-settings-tab="account"><ShieldCheck size={15} />账号安全</button></div><div data-settings-panel="lab"><div class="settings-section-heading"><span class="settings-section-icon"><Building2 size={19} /></span><div><h3>实验室与品牌</h3><p>用于工作台内的组织标识，仅系统管理员可以修改。</p></div></div><form data-lab-settings-form><div class="form-grid"><div class="field full"><label for="settings-app-name">左上角显示名称</label><input id="settings-app-name" maxlength="30" placeholder="OpenLabStock" required /><span class="field-hint">建议使用简短名称，避免在侧栏中截断</span></div><div class="field full"><label for="settings-lab-name">实验室名称</label><input id="settings-lab-name" maxlength="100" autocomplete="organization" required /></div></div><div class="brand-upload"><span class="brand-upload-preview"><Boxes data-brand-preview-default size={25} /><img data-brand-preview-image alt="图标预览" hidden /></span><div class="brand-upload-actions"><label class="button" for="settings-brand-file"><Upload size={15} />选择自定义图标</label><input id="settings-brand-file" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" /><button class="button" type="button" data-remove-brand><Trash2 size={15} />恢复默认</button><p>支持 PNG、JPG、WebP，建议使用正方形图片，最大 512 KB。</p></div></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="button" type="button" data-close-modal>取消</button><button class="button primary" type="submit"><Check size={15} />保存实验室信息</button></div></form></div><div data-settings-panel="groups" hidden><div class="settings-section-heading"><span class="settings-section-icon"><Tags size={19} /></span><div><h3>组织与标签</h3><p>组织分组用于唯一归属和消耗核算；标签用于可多选职责和成员检索。</p></div></div><section class="organization-settings-section"><div class="settings-subheading"><h4>组织分组</h4><p>适用于课题组、公共平台等内部组织。每位成员只能属于一个分组，所有分组共享同一库存。</p></div><form class="add-group-form" data-add-group-form><div class="field"><label for="new-group-name">新组织分组</label><input id="new-group-name" maxlength="40" placeholder="例如：课题组 A" required /></div><button class="button primary" type="submit"><Plus size={15} />添加分组</button></form><div class="group-list" data-groups-settings-list></div></section><section class="organization-settings-section"><div class="settings-subheading"><h4>成员标签</h4><p>适用于采购负责人、危化品、光刻等交叉职责，可为一人选择多个；不参与库存消耗相加。</p></div><div class="tag-list" data-tags-settings-list></div><form class="add-tag-form" data-add-tag-form><div class="field"><label for="new-tag-name">新成员标签</label><input id="new-tag-name" maxlength="24" placeholder="例如：采购负责人" required /></div><button class="button tonal" type="submit"><Plus size={15} />添加标签</button></form></section></div><div data-settings-panel="account" hidden><div class="settings-section-heading"><span class="settings-section-icon"><ShieldCheck size={19} /></span><div><h3>我的资料与账号安全</h3><p>所有成员都可以维护自己的显示信息；密码修改会让其他设备重新登录。</p></div></div><div class="settings-account"><span class="avatar" data-settings-account-avatar>员</span><span><strong data-settings-account-name>当前用户</strong><small data-settings-account-meta>登录账号</small></span></div><form data-profile-form><div class="form-grid"><div class="field full"><label for="profile-name">显示姓名</label><input id="profile-name" maxlength="40" required /></div><div class="field full" data-profile-group-field hidden><label for="profile-group">所属组织分组</label><select id="profile-group" data-group-select></select><span class="field-hint">系统管理员可维护自己的组织归属；变更只影响之后登记的流水。</span></div><div class="field full"><label for="profile-note">成员备注（选填）</label><textarea id="profile-note" maxlength="300" placeholder="例如：负责光刻耗材；联系方式或值班安排"></textarea><span class="field-hint">启用账号的成员都能在成员目录看到这段内容。</span></div><div class="field full"><label>我的职责标签（可多选）</label><div class="tag-picker" data-tag-picker="profile"></div><span class="field-hint">可从管理员维护的标签中选择；标签会显示在成员目录。</span></div></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="button" type="button" data-close-modal>取消</button><button class="button primary" type="submit"><Check size={15} />保存个人资料</button></div></form><form data-password-form><div class="form-grid"><div class="field full"><label for="current-password">当前密码</label><input id="current-password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required /></div><div class="field full"><label for="new-password">新密码</label><input id="new-password" type="password" minlength="8" autocomplete="new-password" required /><span class="field-hint">至少 8 位，建议不要与其他网站共用密码</span></div></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="button" type="button" data-close-modal>取消</button><button class="button primary" type="submit"><Check size={15} />更新密码</button></div></form></div></div></section></div>

    <div class="modal-backdrop" data-modal="notifications"><section class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="notifications-title"><div class="modal-header"><div><h2 id="notifications-title">库存通知</h2><p>需要关注的低库存或有效期</p></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-modal title="关闭"><X size={18} /></button></div><div class="modal-body"><div class="notification-list" data-notification-list></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="button primary" type="button" data-notifications-inventory>查看库存</button></div></div></section></div>

    <div class="modal-backdrop" data-modal="permissions"><section class="modal permission-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="permission-guide-title"><div class="modal-header"><div><h2 id="permission-guide-title">身份与权限</h2><p>不同身份可按实验室分工设置</p></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-modal title="关闭"><X size={18} /></button></div><div class="modal-body"><div class="permission-grid"><article class="permission-role owner"><div class="permission-role-heading"><span class="permission-role-icon"><Star size={16} /></span><strong>系统所有者</strong></div><p>唯一身份。任命和管理系统管理员、转移所有权，并拥有全部系统与库存权限。</p></article><article class="permission-role admin"><div class="permission-role-heading"><span class="permission-role-icon"><ShieldCheck size={16} /></span><strong>系统管理员</strong></div><p>可设置多人。管理品牌、分组、库存管理员和普通成员，并拥有完整库存权限。</p></article><article class="permission-role inventory"><div class="permission-role-heading"><span class="permission-role-icon"><Package size={16} /></span><strong>库存管理员</strong></div><p>可设置多人。维护耗材与安全库存、批量导入，并查看和导出完整库存与流水。</p></article><article class="permission-role member"><div class="permission-role-heading"><span class="permission-role-icon"><Users size={16} /></span><strong>普通成员</strong></div><p>登记入库和领用 / 使用，并查看和导出完整库存与库存活动流水。</p></article></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="button primary" type="button" data-close-modal>知道了</button></div></div></section></div>

    <div class="modal-backdrop" data-modal="material-guide"><section class="modal permission-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="material-guide-title"><div class="modal-header"><div><h2 id="material-guide-title">耗材状态说明</h2><p>耗材档案的使用、归档与清理规则</p></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-modal title="关闭"><X size={18} /></button></div><div class="modal-body"><div class="permission-grid"><article class="permission-role inventory"><div class="permission-role-heading"><span class="permission-role-icon"><Package size={16} /></span><strong>使用中</strong></div><p>正常参与库存统计、库存预警和出入库登记。</p></article><article class="permission-role member"><div class="permission-role-heading"><span class="permission-role-icon"><Archive size={16} /></span><strong>已归档</strong></div><p>默认隐藏，可由库存管理员筛选查看和恢复，不参与日常库存。</p></article><article class="permission-role admin"><div class="permission-role-heading"><span class="permission-role-icon"><Trash2 size={16} /></span><strong>永久删除</strong></div><p>系统所有者或系统管理员可对库存为 0 的耗材执行；档案不可恢复，但历史流水保留。</p></article></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="button primary" type="button" data-close-modal>知道了</button></div></div></section></div>

    <div class="modal-backdrop" data-modal="transaction-correction"><section class="modal correction-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="correction-title" aria-describedby="correction-impact"><div class="modal-header"><div><h2 id="correction-title">更正登记</h2><p>保留原记录，并新增一笔反向冲销流水</p></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-modal title="关闭"><X size={18} /></button></div><div class="modal-body"><div class="correction-summary" data-correction-summary><strong>原登记</strong><span>请选择要更正的记录</span></div><form data-correction-form><div class="form-grid"><div class="field full"><label for="correction-quantity">冲销数量</label><input id="correction-quantity" type="number" min="0.000001" step="any" required /><span class="field-hint" data-correction-quantity-hint></span></div><div class="field full"><label for="correction-reason">更正原因</label><textarea id="correction-reason" maxlength="300" placeholder="例如：数量误填、选错耗材或重复登记" required></textarea><span class="field-hint">原因会写入新流水，便于其他成员理解变更。</span></div></div><div class="correction-impact" id="correction-impact"><span><Info size={17} /></span><span data-correction-impact>系统不会修改或删除原始流水。</span></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="button" type="button" data-close-modal>取消</button><button class="button primary" type="submit"><RotateCcwKey size={16} /><span>确认更正</span></button></div></form></div></section></div>

    <div class="modal-backdrop" data-modal="confirm"><section class="modal confirm-modal" role="alertdialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="confirm-title" aria-describedby="confirm-message"><div class="modal-header"><div><h2 id="confirm-title" data-confirm-title>确认操作</h2><p>请确认是否继续</p></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-confirm-cancel title="关闭"><X size={18} /></button></div><div class="modal-body"><div class="confirm-content"><span class="confirm-icon"><AlertTriangle size={20} /></span><div class="confirm-copy"><strong>此操作无法自动撤销</strong><p id="confirm-message" data-confirm-message></p></div></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="button" type="button" data-confirm-cancel>取消</button><button class="button danger-filled" type="button" data-confirm-submit>确认</button></div></div></section></div>

    <div class="modal-backdrop" data-modal="audit-detail"><section class="modal audit-detail-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="audit-detail-title"><div class="modal-header"><div><h2 id="audit-detail-title" data-audit-detail-title>审计详情</h2><p data-audit-detail-subtitle>管理员操作的不可变记录</p></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-modal title="关闭"><X size={18} /></button></div><div class="modal-body"><dl class="audit-detail-meta"><div><dt>时间</dt><dd data-audit-detail-time>-</dd></div><div><dt>操作者</dt><dd data-audit-detail-actor>-</dd></div><div><dt>对象</dt><dd data-audit-detail-target>-</dd></div><div><dt>来源</dt><dd data-audit-detail-source>-</dd></div><div class="full"><dt>操作摘要</dt><dd data-audit-detail-summary>-</dd></div><div class="full"><dt>请求编号</dt><dd data-audit-detail-request>-</dd></div></dl><div class="audit-change-grid"><section><h3>变更前</h3><div class="audit-snapshot" data-audit-detail-before><p class="empty-note">无变更前快照</p></div></section><section><h3>变更后</h3><div class="audit-snapshot" data-audit-detail-after><p class="empty-note">无变更后快照</p></div></section></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="button primary" type="button" data-close-modal>关闭</button></div></div></section></div>

    <div class="modal-backdrop" data-modal="inventory-unit-edit"><section class="modal inventory-unit-edit-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="inventory-unit-edit-title"><div class="modal-header"><div><h2 id="inventory-unit-edit-title" data-inventory-unit-edit-title>编辑库存单元信息</h2><p data-inventory-unit-edit-subtitle>只维护库存单元资料，不改变当前数量或历史流水</p></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-modal title="关闭"><X size={18} /></button></div><div class="modal-body"><div class="correction-impact inventory-unit-edit-impact"><span><Info size={17} /></span><span>数量变化请使用入库、领用 / 使用、处置或盘点调整；这里仅补全批次资料。</span></div><form data-inventory-unit-edit-form><div class="form-grid"><div class="field full"><label for="edit-inventory-unit-label">批次 / 盒标签</label><input id="edit-inventory-unit-label" maxlength="80" required /><span class="field-hint">历史库存可在这里改成真实批次号或盒号。</span></div><div class="field"><label for="edit-inventory-unit-capacity">容量（0 表示不限）</label><input id="edit-inventory-unit-capacity" type="number" min="0" step="any" required /></div><div class="field"><label for="edit-inventory-unit-expiry-date">有效期 / 保质期（选填）</label><input id="edit-inventory-unit-expiry-date" type="date" /><span class="field-hint">清空日期即可取消提醒；修改后立即重新计算临期和过期状态。</span></div><div class="field full"><label for="edit-inventory-unit-note">备注</label><textarea id="edit-inventory-unit-note" maxlength="500" placeholder="例如：从旧表补录，待下次盘点核对"></textarea></div></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="button" type="button" data-close-modal>取消</button><button class="button primary" type="submit"><Check size={15} />保存资料</button></div></form></div></section></div>

    <div class="modal-backdrop" data-modal="inventory-detail"><section class="modal tracking-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="inventory-detail-title"><div class="modal-header"><div><h2 id="inventory-detail-title" data-inventory-detail-title>库存明细</h2><p data-inventory-detail-subtitle>状态、批次 / 单件、使用范围与库存明细</p></div><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close-modal title="关闭"><X size={18} /></button></div><div class="modal-body"><div class="segmented tracking-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="库存明细分类"><button class="segment active" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-tracking-tab="units"><Package size={15} />库存明细</button><button class="segment" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-tracking-tab="statuses"><Info size={15} />状态设置</button><button class="segment" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-tracking-tab="events"><ClipboardList size={15} />操作记录</button></div><div data-tracking-panel="units"><div class="tracking-summary"><div><span>开放可用</span><strong data-tracking-shared>0</strong></div><div><span>成员自用</span><strong data-tracking-reserved>0</strong></div><div><span>不可用</span><strong data-tracking-unavailable>0</strong></div><div><span>库存总数</span><strong data-tracking-total>0</strong></div></div><div class="tracking-toolbar"><div class="search"><Search size={16} /><label class="sr-only" for="tracking-search">搜索库存单元</label><input id="tracking-search" placeholder="搜索盒号、批次、序列号、格位、状态或成员" data-tracking-search /></div><button class="button primary" type="button" data-show-unit-create><Plus size={16} />新增批次 / 单件</button></div><p class="field-hint tracking-entry-hint">在这里新增每个批次、盒子或单件；有效期（选填）只需在对应库存单元填写。</p><div class="tracking-unit-list" data-tracking-unit-list><p class="empty-note">正在读取库存明细</p></div><form class="tracking-create-form" data-unit-create-form hidden><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="unit-type">单元类型</label><select id="unit-type"><option value="container">盒 / 容器</option><option value="lot">批次</option><option value="position">序列 / 单件</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="unit-label">盒号 / 批次 / 序列号</label><input id="unit-label" maxlength="80" required /></div><div class="field"><label for="unit-capacity">容量（0 表示不限）</label><input id="unit-capacity" type="number" min="0" step="any" value="0" /></div><div class="field"><label for="unit-expiry-date">有效期 / 保质期（选填）</label><input id="unit-expiry-date" type="date" /><span class="field-hint">批次或库存单元的可选属性；填写后系统会在到期前 30 天提醒。未填写则不会提醒。</span></div><div class="field"><label for="unit-quantity">初始数量（未填写格位时）</label><input id="unit-quantity" type="number" min="0.000001" step="any" value="1" required /></div><div class="field"><label for="unit-status">初始状态</label><select id="unit-status" required></select></div><div class="field"><label for="unit-access">使用范围</label><select id="unit-access"><option value="shared">开放使用</option><option value="user">成员自用</option></select></div><div class="field" data-unit-owner-field hidden><label for="unit-owner">自用成员</label><select id="unit-owner"></select></div><div class="field full"><label for="unit-position-codes">格位编号（选填，每行一个，每个格位数量为 1）</label><textarea id="unit-position-codes" maxlength="2000" placeholder="例如：1-1&#10;1-2&#10;2-1"></textarea></div><div class="field"><label for="unit-counterparty">来源（供应商）</label><input id="unit-counterparty" maxlength="120" /></div><div class="field"><label for="unit-date">发生时间</label><input id="unit-date" type="datetime-local" /></div><div class="field full"><label for="unit-note">备注</label><textarea id="unit-note" maxlength="500"></textarea></div></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="button" type="button" data-hide-unit-create>取消</button><button class="button primary" type="submit"><Check size={15} />创建并入库</button></div></form></div><div data-tracking-panel="statuses" hidden><div class="tracking-status-list" data-tracking-status-list></div><form class="tracking-create-form" data-status-create-form><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="new-inventory-status">新状态名称</label><input id="new-inventory-status" maxlength="30" required /></div><div class="field"><label for="new-inventory-status-kind">状态语义</label><select id="new-inventory-status-kind"><option value="usable">可用</option><option value="pending">暂不可用</option><option value="terminal">终止不可用</option></select></div></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="button primary" type="submit"><Plus size={15} />添加状态</button></div></form></div><div data-tracking-panel="events" hidden><p class="field-hint" data-tracking-event-meta>打开后读取操作记录</p><div class="tracking-event-list" data-tracking-event-list><p class="empty-note">打开后读取操作记录</p></div></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="button primary" type="button" data-close-modal>关闭</button></div></div></section></div>

    <div class="toast" role="status" data-toast><Check size={15} /><span data-toast-message>已保存</span></div>
